    "text": "Statement-I : Two forces <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8869;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;when act at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> each other, the magnitude of their resultant is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;when they act at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the&nbsp;magnitude of their resultant becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;This is possible only when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>.</mo></math><br />Statement-II : In the situation given above.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math><br />In the light of the above statement, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below :",
